Read the gene set matrix (\fBgmx\fR) file.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBfile\fB \fR\- the \fBgmx\fR file path.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the parsed [Gmx](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.HTS.GSEA.Formats.Gmx) gene set matrix object.
.PP
.SH DETAILS
.PP
The \fBgmx\fR format is the transposed version of the \fBgmt\fR format: the first
 column of each row is the gene id and the rest columns are the member gene set ids.
